---
config:
  layout: elk
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: "15px"
    primaryTextColor: "#203040"
    lineColor: "#475569"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#ffffff"
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    nodeSpacing: 25
    rankSpacing: 45
  elk:
    nodePlacementStrategy: BRANDES_KOEPF
    mergeEdges: false
---
flowchart TB
    P[Application purpose<br/>and risk policy]:::terminal -->|Trust and freshness| C[Select usable<br/>chainpoint]:::terminal
    C -->|Pinned requests| D[Untrusted data<br/>and proofs]:::ledger
    C -->|Chosen anchor policy| A[Signed roots<br/>for that chainpoint]:::anchor
    D -->|Required claims| V[Terminal verifies<br/>assets and evidence]:::terminal
    A -->|Accepted commitment| V
    V -->|Verified assets| T[Build blockchain<br/>transaction]:::terminal
    V -->|Verified data| O[Consume data<br/>off-chain]:::terminal
    V -->|Checks fail| R[Refuse verified use]:::neutral
    classDef anchor fill:#e1f3eb,stroke:#2c7155,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#163d2e
    classDef ledger fill:#e6effc,stroke:#416dad,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#203a63
    classDef app fill:#fff0dd,stroke:#a46b25,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#644317
    classDef terminal fill:#eee8fa,stroke:#7856a8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#463064
    classDef neutral fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#687384,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#293342
